Suggests: lightdm, xwayland
Description: Aluminium-inspired Cinnamon desktop skin (theme, wallpaper, profile)
 Iris is a desktop "skin" for Cinnamon: a GTK 3/4 theme, a Cinnamon shell
 theme (panel, menus, notifications, OSD), a wallpaper, and a validated
 gsettings profile that lays the panel out Windows-style at the bottom of the
 screen.
 .
 It ships no forked compositor and no new session components on its own: the
 session files are installed as an opt-in convenience, and every setting is
 checked against the installed GSettings schemas before it is written, so an
 existing desktop is never left in a half-configured state.
